{
  "$comment": "Canonical /api/connector/v1 wire fixtures shared by A (server) and C (connector client). ALL success responses use the {data:...} envelope — clients unwrap and validate. Errors: {error:{code,message}} with HTTP status; codes: stale_lease (session/epoch mismatch, 409), connector_active (another live instance, 409), state_conflict (conflicting terminal ack, 409), unauthenticated (unknown/revoked token, 401), not_found (foreign/unknown command, 404), batch_too_large (422). Raw reporting credentials attach ONLY at launch delivery as payload.reportingCredential and are never stored in payloads.",
